        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Priority-ordered, kernel-managed message passing between processes",
      "source_hash": 6870409398288187046,
      "context_hash": 4778518112997503789,
      "translation": "우선순위에 따라 정렬되고 커널이 관리하는 프로세스 간 메시지 전달",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Overview",
      "source_hash": 11777448466030057203,
      "context_hash": 5529662103395365038,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "POSIX message queues (`mq_open`, `mq_send`, `mq_receive`) provide a message-passing IPC mechanism with:",
      "source_hash": 3958104427968187416,
      "context_hash": 9856081807634993029,
      "translation": "POSIX 메시지 큐(`mq_open`, `mq_send`, `mq_receive`)는 다음과 같은 특성을 갖춘 메시지 전달 IPC 메커니즘을 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IPC": "IPC",
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Priority ordering**: messages are dequeued highest-priority first",
      "source_hash": 15493832007379665633,
      "context_hash": 8410375203894233783,
      "translation": "**우선순위 정렬**: 메시지는 우선순위가 가장 높은 것부터 꺼내집니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Blocking and non-blocking**: readers block until a message arrives",
      "source_hash": 9862527098990554544,
      "context_hash": 10959353151679184548,
      "translation": "**블로킹 및 논블로킹**: 읽는 쪽은 메시지가 도착할 때까지 블록됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435052Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Async notification**: `mq_notify` delivers a signal or starts a thread when a message arrives",
      "source_hash": 15892262257373342421,
      "context_hash": 14386937844235918330,
      "translation": "**비동기 알림**: 메시지가 도착하면 `mq_notify`가 시그널을 전달하거나 스레드를 시작합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435052Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Kernel persistence**: queues survive until explicitly deleted or system reboot",
      "source_hash": 3066584119485859096,
      "context_hash": 7198559734661251833,
      "translation": "**커널 지속성**: 큐는 명시적으로 삭제되거나 시스템이 재부팅될 때까지 유지됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435052Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**VFS integration**: queues appear as files under `/dev/mqueue`",
      "source_hash": 15028924264436822081,
      "context_hash": 2808681920022934939,
      "translation": "**VFS 통합**: 큐는 `/dev/mqueue` 아래에 파일로 나타납니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS",
        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:20.435052Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
